  "body_html": "<p>Bring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with this stunning Jeminise quilt set, featuring a lively cactus and floral print. Perfect for adding a touch of nature-inspired elegance and comfort to any bedroom, this bedspread set combines eye-catching design with cozy functionality for year-round enjoyment.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Design:</strong> Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, perfect for adding a pop of nature-inspired beauty to any bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A unique and thoughtful gift for cactus lovers, home décor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates vibrant and cheerful bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in a range of sizes including Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set typically includes one quilt, with the option to add two pillowcases for a complete look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this quilt set is machine washable for effortless cleaning and maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Can be used as a bed quilt, picnic mat, throw blanket, or a thoughtful gift, suitable for use on beds, sofas, or during outdoor activities like camping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalization options may include selecting a size or adding pillowcases and custom text, allowing you to create a unique item.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Style #3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Cactus, Desert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cactus, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Southwestern Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
